# SQLite state (copybot.db especially) is large + high-churn binary.
# Do NOT track in git — use GitHub Actions cache (see copybot.yml) to carry
# live DB state between scheduled runs without poisoning history or bloating clones.
# The public dashboard + research story lives in docs/data.json (small, committed).
copybot.db
trades.db
*.db
v2_trades.db
v2_*.db

# If you ever need a historical DB snapshot: check out an old commit before we
# stopped tracking, or pull the artifact from a recent successful workflow run.
